OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal e-bikes and off-road
OL,4,Avehicles seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FIllegal e-bikes, e-scooters and
OL,7,Foff-road bikes have been seized across
OL,8,Fa city centre as police try to tackle
OL,9,Fanti-social behaviour.
OL,11,FIn response to community concerns about
OL,12,Fthe misuse of e-bikes and e-scooters,
OL,13,Fofficers seized 27 vehicles from
OL,14,FPreston city centre on Sunday,
OL,15,FLancashire Police said.
OL,17,FThese vehicles will now be destroyed.
OL,19,FInsp Adam Pearson said: "Removing these
OL,20,Fvehicles helps make our streets safer
OL,21,Fand sends a clear message that this
OL,22,Fbehaviour will not be tolerated."
